ributionDocument', 'details': '# GitLab: Update Contribution Document SOP - Enhanced\\n\\n## Overview\\nThis SOP outlines the complete process for updating a contribution document in a GitLab repository and creating a merge request, including handling browser timeout issues.\\n\\n## Prerequisites\\n- GitLab credentials (username: root, password: theagentcompany)\\n- Access to the GitLab instance at http://the-agent-company.com:8929/\\n- Repository access to the project\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Clone the Repository\\n```bash\\ncd /workspace\\ngit clone http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia.git\\n```\\n\\n### 2. Navigate to Contribution Document\\n- Check if CONTRIBUTING.md exists in root directory\\n- If not, check docs/pages/contribution/contribution.md\\n- Review existing content to understand structure\\n\\n### 3. Update Contribution Document\\nAdd three required sections about development environments:\\n- **Using VS Code with Dev Containers**: Instructions for VS Code Dev Containers setup\\n- **Using Other IDEs or Editors with Dev Containers**: Instructions for Docker Compose, JetBrains IDEs, and command line\\n- **Without Dev Containers**: Traditional development setup with system requirements and installation steps\\n\\n### 4. Commit Changes\\n```bash\\ngit checkout -b update-contribution-doc\\ngit add docs/pages/contribution/contribution.md\\ngit commit -m \"docs: update contribution document with dev container instructions\"\\n```\\n\\n### 5. Push Branch and Create Merge Request\\n```bash\\ngit push origin update-contribution-doc\\n```\\n- GitLab will automatically detect the new branch\\n- When prompted for credentials, use:\\n  - Username: root\\n  - Password: theagentcompany\\n\\n### 6. Create Merge Request (Browser Issues Workaround)\\nIf browser tool times out:\\n1. Use the URL provided in push output:\\n   `http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia/-/merge_requests/new?merge_request%5Bsource_branch%5D=update-contribution-doc`\\n2. Manually navigate to this URL in a working browser\\n3. Set MR title to \"Update contribution document\" as required\\n4. Create the merge request\\n\\n### 7. Alternative API Approach (if authentication works)\\n```bash\\ncurl -X POST \"http://the-agent-company.com:8929/api/v4/projects/13/merge_requests\" \\\\\\n  --user \"root:theagentcompany\" \\\\\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\\\\n  -d \\'{\\n    \"source_branch\": \"update-contribution-doc\",\\n    \"target_branch\": \"main\",\\n    \"title\": \"Update contribution document\",\\n    \"description\": \"Updates contribution document with development environment instructions\"\\n  }\\'\\n```\\n\\n## Notes\\n- The contribution document should be comprehensive and cover multiple development approaches\\n- Include practical examples and code snippets where appropriate\\n- Ensure all three required subtitles are included\\n- The merge request title should match the specific task requirement\\n- Browser timeout issues may require manual intervention for MR creation\\n- GitLab project ID for sotopia is 13'}, thought='Now let me summarize what has been accomplished and create a comprehensive SOP for this operation since we successfully completed the main parts of the task.', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'UpdateContributionDocument\\' for platform \\'GitLab\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'GitLab', 'operation': 'UpdateContributionDocument', 'details': '# GitLab: Update Contribution Document SOP - Enhanced\\n\\n## Overview\\nThis SOP outlines the complete process for updating a contribution document in a GitLab repository and creating a merge request, including handling browser timeout issues.\\n\\n## Prerequisites\\n- GitLab credentials (username: root, password: theagentcompany)\\n- Access to the GitLab instance at http://the-agent-company.com:8929/\\n- Repository access to the project\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Clone the Repository\\n```bash\\ncd /workspace\\ngit clone http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia.git\\n```\\n\\n### 2. Navigate to Contribution Document\\n- Check if CONTRIBUTING.md exists in root directory\\n- If not, check docs/pages/contribution/contribution.md\\n- Review existing content to understand structure\\n\\n### 3. Update Contribution Document\\nAdd three required sections about development environments:\\n- **Using VS Code with Dev Containers**: Instructions for VS Code Dev Containers setup\\n- **Using Other IDEs or Editors with Dev Containers**: Instructions for Docker Compose, JetBrains IDEs, and command line\\n- **Without Dev Containers**: Traditional development setup with system requirements and installation steps\\n\\n### 4. Commit Changes\\n```bash\\ngit checkout -b update-contribution-doc\\ngit add docs/pages/contribution/contribution.md\\ngit commit -m \"docs: update contribution document with dev container instructions\"\\n```\\n\\n### 5. Push Branch and Create Merge Request\\n```bash\\ngit push origin update-contribution-doc\\n```\\n- GitLab will automatically detect the new branch\\n- When prompted for credentials, use:\\n  - Username: root\\n  - Password: theagentcompany\\n\\n### 6. Create Merge Request (Browser Issues Workaround)\\nIf browser tool times out:\\n1. Use the URL provided in push output:\\n   `http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia/-/merge_requests/new?merge_request%5Bsource_branch%5D=update-contribution-doc`\\n2. Manually navigate to this URL in a working browser\\n3. Set MR title to \"Update contribution document\" as required\\n4. Create the merge request\\n\\n### 7. Alternative API Approach (if authentication works)\\n```bash\\ncurl -X POST \"http://the-agent-company.com:8929/api/v4/projects/13/merge_requests\" \\\\\\n  --user \"root:theagentcompany\" \\\\\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\\\\n  -d \\'{\\n    \"source_branch\": \"update-contribution-doc\",\\n    \"target_branch\": \"main\",\\n    \"title\": \"Update contribution document\",\\n    \"description\": \"Updates contribution document with development environment instructions\"\\n  }\\'\\n```\\n\\n## Notes\\n- The contribution document should be comprehensive and cover multiple development approaches\\n- Include practical examples and code snippets where appropriate\\n- Ensure all three required subtitles are included\\n- The merge request title should match the specific task requirement\\n- Browser timeout issues may require manual intervention for MR creation\\n- GitLab project ID for sotopia is 13'}), AgentFinishAction(final_thought='\\nI have successfully completed the task to update the contribution document in the sotopia project and prepare for creating a merge request. Here\\'s what was accomplished:\\n\\n## \u2705 Completed Tasks:\\n\\n1. **Cloned the sotopia repository** to /workspace directory\\n2. **Located the contribution document** at docs/pages/contribution/contribution.md\\n3. **Updated the contribution document** with three required sections:\\n   - **Using VS Code with Dev Containers**: Detailed instructions for VS Code Dev Containers setup\\n   - **Using Other IDEs or Editors with Dev Containers**: Instructions for Docker Compose, JetBrains IDEs, and command line development\\n   - **Without Dev Containers**: Traditional development setup with system requirements and installation steps\\n\\n4. **Committed the changes** to a new branch called `update-contribution-doc`\\n5. **Pushed the branch** to GitLab with credentials (root/theagentcompany)\\n6. **Updated the SOP guide** with the complete workflow for future reference\\n\\n## \ud83d\udccb Merge Request Information:\\n\\n- **Branch**: `update-contribution-doc` \\n- **Target branch**: `main`\\n- **Required MR title**: \"Update contribution document\"\\n- **GitLab URL for MR creation**: http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia/-/merge_requests/new?merge_request%5Bsource_branch%5D=update-contribution-doc\\n\\n## \u26a0\ufe0f Note:\\nThe browser tool experienced timeout issues when trying to create the merge request through the web interface. However, the branch has been successfully pushed and GitLab has provided the direct URL to create the merge request. The merge request needs to be created manually through the GitLab web interface using the provided URL with the title \"Update contribution document\".\\n\\nThe contribution document now includes comprehensive instructions for developers to set up their development environment using their preferred tools and workflows, covering all three required approaches.\\n', task_completed='partial', outputs={}, thought='Perfect! I have successfully completed the main parts of the task. Let me provide a final summary of what was accomplished.', action=<ActionType.FINISH: 'finish'>)], inputs={}, outputs={}, agent_state=<AgentState.FINISHED: 'finished'>, resume_state=None, traffic_control_state=<TrafficControlState.NORMAL: 'normal'>, metrics=Metrics({'accumulated_cost': 0.23963980999999998, 'accumulated_token_usage': {'model': 'default', 'prompt_tokens': 3074113, 'completion_tokens': 5519, 'cache_read_tokens': 2982208, 'cache_write_tokens': 0, 'context_window': 65536, 'per_turn_token': 100410, 'response_id': ''}, 'costs': [{'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00057059, 'timestamp': 1761994723.2518637}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0005825400000000001, 'timestamp': 1761994725.467004}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0007111000000000001, 'timestamp': 1761994730.3331325}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00063686, 'timestamp': 1761994733.2117083}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0007862500000000001, 'timestamp': 1761994736.9650574}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0034438600000000004, 'timestamp': 1761994